Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  我们得知该片于凌晨三点十六分上传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, we also know it was uploaded at 3.16am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.05,0:17:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用回溯查看全国在当时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I ran a nationwide traceback on uninterrupted one-way uploads
