Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.98,0:18:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,[第三部分]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有信心吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.53,0:18:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点纠结  处理下就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a kick-bollock scramble, but with finessing it should be OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.44,0:18:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好快点  演员快来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finesse quickly. Our performers on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.29,0:18:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从未遇到这种情况  通常我不会答应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a new one for me, obviously. I wouldnt normally... You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.09,0:19:00.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有看过我的电影吗?  - 没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You seen any of my films? -  No.
