Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.94,0:19:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在想  发票上怎么写呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I put on the invoice? Thats what I'm wondering.
