Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.59,0:19:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特警队正赶往位于白金汉郡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goon squads heading for postcode in Buckinghamshire.
