Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡莱特探员  这位是弗林先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Callett, this is Mr Flynn.
