Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.04,0:20:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现疑似入口  有何指示?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, team red... Any orders, boss?
