Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:49.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离截止时间下午四点还有三个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With the 4pm deadline three hours away,
