Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.08,0:31:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然是驱车向西前往班克赛德演播室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Appears to be heading west to Bankside Studios.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.64,0:32:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经颁布法令...  从明天凌晨开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weve ratified the law... after midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.44,0:32:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,储存任何相关图像和视频的行为都被视为非法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it'll be a criminal offence to store any recording or images of the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经告诫民众请勿观看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theyre doing an announcement to warn people off even watching,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.74,0:32:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会播放蜂鸣声来使民众感到恶心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some sonic tone that causes nausea.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.64,0:32:25.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当公众意见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When public opinion has very much hardened,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.72,0:32:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在邮寄断指事件后如此强硬时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}following the delivery of the princesss severed finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:31.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随着下午四点的临近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the 4pm deadline approaches,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.54,0:32:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个国家万人空巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the nation is at a standstill
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.84,0:32:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关注这一重大事件的发展走向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}watching the extraordinary situation play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.72,0:32:41.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得不说  这一事件已经引起全球关注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just to remind you, this is now a story of global significance...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.60,0:32:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克尔·卡洛展现了非凡的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Michael Callow has displayed incredible bravery"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事关生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"in what was a matter of life or death."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.04,0:32:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是开场白  接着...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thats how it opens, then we should move on...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.92,0:32:53.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.56,0:32:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备就绪了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.56,0:32:57.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, maam.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.95,0:32:58.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下药了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sedated?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.68,0:33:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经注射过了  很温顺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Injection. It's docile.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.84,0:33:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该进去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to go in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前所未有的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An unprecedented nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.44,0:33:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一份官方声明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an official announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.32,0:33:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首相将会做出一些不雅的行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Prime Minister will perform an indecent act on your screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.64,0:33:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以期确保公主的安全释放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the hope that it will ensure the release of Princess Susannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.92,0:33:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何录影和储存将被视为非法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recording or possessing a copy of this broadcast will become illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.32,0:33:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建议所有观众立即关闭电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All viewers are advised to turn off their televisions immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.48,0:33:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在以下蜂鸣后正式开始播放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The broadcast will commence after the following tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.63,0:34:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为遵守规则  您必须不停的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're complying with the stipulated rules. So you have to keep going...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.84,0:34:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您必须坚持到最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}youll have to see it through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.71,0:34:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,视线等高处会播放性爱视频\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weve placed visual aids in your eyeline, which might help if you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.36,0:34:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防您有某些麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.45,0:34:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心理学家建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suggestion were getting from psychologists
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.11,0:34:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你尽可能把时间放长一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is that you should take as long as you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.26,0:34:54.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您表现匆促  会被误解为饥渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you rush, it might be misinterpreted as eagerness
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.99,0:34:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至愉悦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or even enjoyment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.73,0:35:12.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面只有一个摄像团队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a skeleton crew inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,环境完全封闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closed set.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.12,0:36:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他出现啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.72,0:36:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望此举能换回苏珊娜公主的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust this will bring about the safe return of Princess Susannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.48,0:36:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.78,0:36:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.36,0:36:35.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿上帝宽恕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.88,0:38:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  这家伙太惨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus! Poor bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.44,0:38:43.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都快一个小时了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But its been on for nearly an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.44,0:38:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在见证历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's history, this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.32,0:39:48.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们找到苏珊娜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weve got her. Susannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.43,0:39:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把她放了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They released her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.97,0:39:53.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在城里乱撞呢  被下了药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stumbling about in the city. Sedated.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.02,0:39:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都不记得  但毫发无伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She can't remember anything, but she's unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.53,0:39:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她的手指?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But her finger?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.48,0:39:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是她的  DNA显示是男性手指\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not hers. DNA shows its male.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.88,0:39:59.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.83,0:40:04.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有  监控录像在三点半拍到了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is one other thing. There's a CCTV grab of her from half three.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.60,0:40:09.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在离四点还有半小时就被释放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems he let her go 30 minutes before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.74,0:40:11.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.34,0:40:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想他料到大家都会在室内看电视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guess... he knew everyone would be elsewhere watching screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.64,0:40:21.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说这是一份宣言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So its a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.68,0:40:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这事到此为止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what this was all about, making a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:27.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要不要...?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we, er...?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:28.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报告中不要把这事写进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose that page of the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.44,0:40:32.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确保没人知道这事  尤其是首相本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No-one sees it, especially the PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.28,0:40:33.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.16,0:40:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好消息  迈克尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good news, Michael.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.28,0:40:48.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您救了她  她还活着  安然无恙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved her. Susannahs alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.56,0:41:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在遭受羞辱一周年当天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the one-year anniversary of his humiliating ordeal,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.24,0:41:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迈克尔·卡洛很自信  显然没有受到影响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an apparently unconcerned Michael Callow put in an assured performance
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.36,0:41:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在妻子简的陪同下与公众会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a public appearance, accompanied by his wife Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.36,0:42:00.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该事件其他中心人物也接受了采访\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other central figure in events was also before the camera
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.88,0:42:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在昨晚的英勇儿童颁奖会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at last nights Children Of Valour Awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.84,0:42:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,苏珊娜公主在宣布怀孕后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Princess Susannah made her first public appearance
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.64,0:42:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首度出现在公共场合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since announcing her pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.28,0:42:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一年前  特纳奖得主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was one year ago that the Turner Prize-winning artist,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.40,0:42:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艺术家卡尔顿·布鲁姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Carlton Bloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.38,0:42:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迫使首相做出不雅之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coerced the Prime Minister into committing an indecent act.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.49,0:42:24.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随着一周年的到来  一则艺术评论引发了争议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As the anniversary arrived, one art critic caused controversy
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.39,0:42:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该评论称其为本世纪首部伟大作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by describing it as "the first great artwork of the 21st century".
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然而文化学者则持相反的观点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While cultural commentators debate its significance,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.32,0:42:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毋庸置疑  全球十三亿的收视率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a global audience of 1.3 billion,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.08,0:42:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个全民参与的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was an event in which we all participated.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.86,0:42:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这次事件并未击垮首相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The incident failed to destroy a Prime Minister,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.84,0:42:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的支持率同比高出了三个百分点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who holds an approval rating three points higher than last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.39,0:42:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,达蒙·布朗  UKN\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damon Brown, UKN.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.84,0:42:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.27,0:42:56.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简  求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jane, please.
